ba(129, 139, 152, 0.12); border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em;&quot;&gt;[State]&lt;/code&gt;：Agent 的当前状态和上下文信息&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; tab-size: 4; white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(129, 139, 152, 0.12); border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em;&quot;&gt;[Evidence]&lt;/code&gt;：从外部知识库检索的证据信息&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; tab-size: 4; white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(129, 139, 152, 0.12); border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em;&quot;&gt;[Context]&lt;/code&gt;：历史对话和相关记忆&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; tab-size: 4; white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(129, 139, 152, 0.12); border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em;&quot;&gt;[Output]&lt;/code&gt;：期望的输出格式和要求&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
